Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 11)
Standards-Version: 1.2.6
Homepage: https://drumee.org

Package: drumee-bootstrap
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Description: Drumee interactive bare-metal installer
 Interactive first-run installer for a bare-metal or fresh-VM Drumee
 deployment. Runs a guided debconf setup wizard that configures the full
 Drumee stack (domain, networking, SSL, storage, and services) from
 pre-built artifacts. For a pre-configured, non-interactive (apt/IaC)
 install use the drumee-infra package built from the infra/ directory,
 optionally driven by an install.conf preseed (see config/render.mjs).
